<title>JAPAN: Catena - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Catena - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 40.65		vs	   37.69</p>
<p> Operating	  506    million	  vs	    1.09</p>
<p> Current	    289    million	  vs	  750    million</p>
